	<item>
		<title>Full segment from 11/13 WWE SmackDown featuring Sami Zayn, Kevin Owens, Johnny Gargano and Candice LaRae</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397427-full-segment-from-11-13-wwe-smackdown-featuring-sami-zayn-kevin-owens-johnny-gargano-and-candice-larae/</link>
