			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Report: Plaintiff claims injuries sustained in case against WWE talent</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397375-report-plaintiff-claims-injuries-sustained-in-case-against-wwe-talent/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397375-report-plaintiff-claims-injuries-sustained-in-case-against-wwe-talent/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:57:41 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Battery case]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Ludwig Kaiser]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397375</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>A new legal filing has provided details on injuries claimed to be sustained by Richard Reap, the plaintiff&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397375-report-plaintiff-claims-injuries-sustained-in-case-against-wwe-talent/">Report: Plaintiff claims injuries sustained in case against WWE talent</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A new legal filing has provided details on injuries claimed to be sustained by Richard Reap, the plaintiff in a battery case against Ludwig Kaiser.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The WWE talent&#8217;s defense team submitted a notion on November 12 asking the court to issue a subpoena directing Reap to produce medical records related to the incident.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">New details from the filing reveal that Reap is claiming a torn rotator cuff and a concussion as a result from the altercation, and that Reap sought medical care for those injuries.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Kaiser&#8217;s defense is arguing that access to Reap&#8217;s medical records from April 23-November 12 is vital to their preparation for the case, and material to evaluating the nature of these injuries.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Reap&#8217;s attorney and Assistant State Attorney Juanda Padgett have indicated they object to the subpoena being issued, though Padgett initially agreed to share the medical records with Kaiser&#8217;s defense before Reap objected.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A pre-trial conference for the case is scheduled for December 17, with a potential trial period currently listed of January 4-22, 2027.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://www.f4wonline.com/news/wwe/alleged-victim-claims-he-suffered-torn-rotator-cuff-concussion-in-ludwig-kaiser-battery-case/">F4WOnline</a></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397375-report-plaintiff-claims-injuries-sustained-in-case-against-wwe-talent/">Report: Plaintiff claims injuries sustained in case against WWE talent</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397375-report-plaintiff-claims-injuries-sustained-in-case-against-wwe-talent/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Ratings round-up for AEW Collision on TNT and TNA IMPACT on AMC</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397368-ratings-round-up-for-aew-collision-on-tnt-and-tna-impact-on-amc/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397368-ratings-round-up-for-aew-collision-on-tnt-and-tna-impact-on-amc/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:36:44 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[11/5/26 TNA IMPACT on AMC ratings]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[11/7/26 AEW Collision ratings]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397368</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>The November 5 episode of TNA IMPACT on AMC drew 194,000 viewers on the network, scoring a 0.03&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397368-ratings-round-up-for-aew-collision-on-tnt-and-tna-impact-on-amc/">Ratings round-up for AEW Collision on TNT and TNA IMPACT on AMC</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The November 5 episode of <a href="https://wrestlenomics.com/articles/2026/tna-impact-nov-5-on-amc-194000-viewers-0-03-p18-49-rating-tv-ratings-analysis/">TNA IMPACT on AMC</a> drew 194,000 viewers on the network, scoring a 0.03 rating in the key 18-49 demographic.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The previous week&#8217;s show drew 202,000 viewers and scored a 0.03 rating.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe title="Shotzi Blackheart BACK IN ACTION Against Reunited Fire &amp;apos;N Flava | TNA iMPACT! November 5, 2026" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ePtkc2s1dyk?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The <a href="https://wrestlenomics.com/articles/2026/aew-collision-nov-7-on-tnt-376000-viewers-0-08-p18-49-rating-tv-ratings-analysis/">November 7 episode of AEW Collision</a> on TNT, airing live from Jericho&#8217;s Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager at Sea docked in Miami drew 376,000 viewers and scored a 0.08 rating in key 18-49 demographic.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These numbers are up from the taped Fright Night episode, which drew 302,000 viewers and scored a 0.06 rating for the night.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe loading="lazy" title="AND NEW! Tommaso Ciampa becomes AEW National Champion! | AEW Collision: Jericho Cruise 2026" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/mRnrmSzDlrA?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://wrestlenomics.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Wrestlenomics</a></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397368-ratings-round-up-for-aew-collision-on-tnt-and-tna-impact-on-amc/">Ratings round-up for AEW Collision on TNT and TNA IMPACT on AMC</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397368-ratings-round-up-for-aew-collision-on-tnt-and-tna-impact-on-amc/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Report: CM Punk could land a huge backstage role in NXT next year</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397360-report-cm-punk-could-land-a-huge-backstage-role-in-nxt-next-year/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397360-report-cm-punk-could-land-a-huge-backstage-role-in-nxt-next-year/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:31:17 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Backsage role]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[CM Punk]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NXT]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397360</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>PWInsider is reporting that when Shawn Michaels leaves his current role as Senior Vice President of Talent Development&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397360-report-cm-punk-could-land-a-huge-backstage-role-in-nxt-next-year/">Report: CM Punk could land a huge backstage role in NXT next year</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://pwinsider.com/article/213645/exclusive-who-is-expected-to-replace-shawn-michaels-overseeing-wwe-nxt-and-more.html?p=1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">PWInsider</a> is reporting that when Shawn Michaels leaves his current role as Senior Vice President of Talent Development Creative, to take over Bruce Prichard&#8217;s role, WWE is looking at giving the spot of Michaels in NXT to CM Punk. Prichard is expected to retire from his Executive Director role after WrestleMania 43 next year and work as a consultant from his home in Texas. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The report also notes that Punk has been at the WWE Performance Center in Orlando, Florida for most of the NXT episodes in recent weeks.  </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">PWInsider writes, “We are told there is no firm timeline for Punk to step into the role as the company wants everyone involved to take time to ensure it’s the right fit for all involved, but internally, Punk is who they are currently looking towards to slip into Michaels’ position when Michaels needs to step into [Bruce] Prichard’s responsibilities.&#8221; </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">AJ Styles, who retired earlier this year from in-ring competition, currently assists with scouting talent and also the WWE ID program. In addition, Styles has been filling in for Terry Taylor as a coach, while Taylor recovers from his recent knee surgery. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">PWInsider further notetes Michaels is expected to start splitting time between NXT and the main roster, as preparation for his new role following WrestleMania 43.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Punk is scheduled for this Saturday&#8217;s NXT house show at the Fox Theatre in Detroit, Michigan and then this Sunday&#8217;s NXT house show in his hometown of Chicago at the Portage Theater.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397360-report-cm-punk-could-land-a-huge-backstage-role-in-nxt-next-year/">Report: CM Punk could land a huge backstage role in NXT next year</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397360-report-cm-punk-could-land-a-huge-backstage-role-in-nxt-next-year/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>ECW original announces he&#8217;s signed a WWE legends deal</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397353-ecw-original-announces-hes-signed-a-wwe-legends-deal/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397353-ecw-original-announces-hes-signed-a-wwe-legends-deal/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:02:57 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Legends deal]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Spike Dudley]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397353</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>ECW original Spike Dudley (real name Matt Hyson), announced on Facebook he&#8217;s signed a WWE legends deal. “Very&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397353-ecw-original-announces-hes-signed-a-wwe-legends-deal/">ECW original announces he&#8217;s signed a WWE legends deal</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">ECW original Spike Dudley (real name Matt Hyson), announced on Facebook he&#8217;s signed a WWE legends deal. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>“Very happy to announce I just signed a WWE Legends deal. Will keep you posted with merch,” he wrote. “Thank you to all friends, family and fans that made it possible!!!!”</em></p>



<iframe loading="lazy" src="https://www.facebook.com/plugins/video.php?height=476&#038;href=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Freel%2F1182277547458809%2F&#038;show_text=true&#038;width=267&#038;t=0" width="267" height="591" style="border:none;overflow:hidden" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="true" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowFullScreen="true"></iframe>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Hyson filed a trademark application earlier for the “Spike Dudley” name, specifically for merchandising purposes. However, back in September, WWE was granted a 90-day extension to potentially oppose the trademark filing by Hyson. He abandoned his trademark at the beginning of his month, with WWE then submitting their own trademark<a href="https://www.f4wonline.com/news/wwe/wwe-files-new-spike-dudley-trademark-after-potential-dispute/"> application</a> for the “Spike Dudley” name.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He wrestled in ECW from 1996 to 2001 and then WWE from 2001 to 2015. He also wrestled and made appearances in TNA between 2006 and most recently at the 2025 Bound For Glory PPV. In TNA he was called &#8220;Brother Spike&#8221; and &#8220;Brother Runt.&#8221;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The 56-year old Hyson currently works as a financial transition specialist with Fidelity Investments.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397353-ecw-original-announces-hes-signed-a-wwe-legends-deal/">ECW original announces he&#8217;s signed a WWE legends deal</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397353-ecw-original-announces-hes-signed-a-wwe-legends-deal/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
