										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This past Tuesday&#8217;s NXT, back in its normal Tuesday timeslot of 8:00 pm ET on the CW, came in with 588,000 viewers and a 0.11 rating in the key 18-49 demographic.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Last week&#8217;s show, which aired on Wednesday, due to the CW&#8217;s live coverage of the mid-terms elections, up against AEW&#8217;s Dynamite Blood &amp; Guts on TBS (and HBO Max), drew 552,000 viewers and a 0.13 rating.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://wrestlenomics.com/articles/2026/wwe-nxt-nov-10-on-cw-588000-viewers-0-11-p18-49-rating-tv-ratings-analysis/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Wrestlenomics</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">CW Sports has posted Tuesday&#8217;s full episode on YouTube, which can be seen below.</p>



